  "body": "Price reduced - Vendor instructed to sell\r\n\r\nWelcome to this substantial family home  with spacious balcony, seaviews, ferry sunset & Sky Tower views in the heart of Half Moon Bay, offering space, flexibility and a fantastic coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\n• 5 generous bedrooms & 3 bathrooms\r\n• Flexible lower-level living with 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom & separate lounge\r\n• Master bedroom with ensuite & walk-in wardrobe\r\n• Large open-plan kitchen, dining & living\r\n• Double internal-access garage + separate single garage\r\n• Opportunity to modernise and add your own touch\r\n\r\nShort stroll to Half Moon Bay Marina, with easy access to ferries, coastal walks, beaches, cafés and local amenities.\r\nZoned for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate & Pigeon Mountain Primary and all with in walking destance,  This is an ideal opportunity for families seeking a combination of spacious living, coastal lifestyle, and quality educational options.\r\n\r\nOverseas vendor highly motivated to sell – clear instructions.\r\n\r\nContact us today or join us at the Saturday/Sunday Open Home.\r\n\r\nAll conjunctions welcome.",
